---
import ServicePage from '../layouts/ServicePage.astro';
---

<ServicePage
  slug="business-start-up-advice"
  title="Business start-up advice & support"
  eyebrow="Service 01"
  lead="Starting a new venture should be exciting. As a new business owner, your focus needs to be on strategic planning and mapping out your growth potential, not paperwork."
  description="Start-up advice from Belfast accountants: business structure, Companies House and HMRC registration, and financing options including Invest NI."
  asideTitle="Starting a business? Let's talk."
  emailSubject="Business start-up advice"
>
  <section class="prose">
    <p>
      The way you structure your business to start off with can impact your future profits and scalability. Our
      business advisors have a proven track record of supporting entrepreneurs.
    </p>
    <p>
      From company formation to the execution of payroll, bookkeeping and accounts, our expert accountants will listen
      to your needs and goals and design a bespoke accountancy package, so you can focus on nurturing your new
      business without hiring costly in-house personnel.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="help-heading">
    <h2 id="help-heading" class="h3">How we help</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>
        <span class="badge" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Structure</h3>
          <p>
            We'll advise on the best foot forward for a successful venture, whether you're self-employed as a sole
            trader, acting as a partnership, or running a limited company.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="badge" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Paperwork</h3>
          <p>
            Once you've decided how your business will operate, the paperwork starts. We take care of Companies House
            and HMRC registration, plus payroll, accounts, invoicing, tax returns, expense management, budgeting and
            forecasting.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="badge" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Financing</h3>
          <p>
            We can advise on financing options for your new business. Our relationships with local business-orientated
            banks and organisations like Invest NI give us real insight into how best to seek financial support.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>
</ServicePage>
